ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=frhknThy8D4Q7kNvwGUp_cJ&_nc_oc=Adoq0VyCbxRwXeZkCXcYKZp3pJePoLDulOF6mP5Rsye8f8vxmZcKCiV2E7ThDZwuIA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7YP2uLAkkyil9aU9gGoKSdM6aiR9emCl8F5T3cv9hZ3Q&oe=6A202CB9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OMJ26Bm1EZkQ7kNvwF-ZS8z&_nc_oc=AdoTHbC9j7J56ECQf-_uP5JPRYGSiHikiqEe2J6lVDGuF6MZxxaMLpwJiFNuJ3IofRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ih61h-dR-gpeAgys40fE61W8KiKKbdfVRQCwFulqJMw&oe=6A201B0F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zBN3Pfa4ZQwQ7kNvwFdin0l&_nc_oc=AdrAhYZ_HAnHOnMQ1Jokek2fnMv5ZiycPTZU1u8Ze2_4R8azuUbWmD3x_Ql5GyeEovQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6er6vFteyL2nq6M9-5yd2Wx07uvalHMOaaLMdMWYYcBg&oe=6A2028EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa